{"id": "DeMmCg5PlmM", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"BOOK\" to get Replit and start building your own booking system with AI.\n\nYou don't need to pay for a booking tool anymore.\n\nI just built my own on Replit.\n\nAnd it even takes payments.\n\nI just described what I wanted.\n\nAnd it built the whole thing.\n\nFrom the calendar structure, to the availability rules, to the confirmation emails.\n\nThen I asked it to add a way to receive payment.\n\nStripe is already built in.\n\nSo that was complete in a single prompt and sign in.\n\nPlus you can put it live on your own domain.\n\nThat's all it took.\n\nThink of it like hiring a receptionist who never sleeps and never asks for a salary.\n\nMost booking tools charge you a monthly fee just to keep your calendar running.\n\nThis one is yours to customize however you want.\n\nYou can change the availability rules whenever you need to.\n\nYou can adjust the confirmation emails to sound like you.\n\nAnd you never have to write a single line of code yourself.\n\nYour clients can book and pay in one place.\n\nNo third party booking page with someone else's branding on it.\n\nIt all lives on your own domain instead.\n\n#ReplitPartner #ReplitAI  #AiCoding #VibeCoding #bookingsystem", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1791384090, "like_count": 805, "comment_count": 665, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1781198142823469a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.004, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOhfoXg1oLGJ6r4zTdd8DCNxV3zVRmYxq0Czn5BXBLLIOstIZL8AH5Ov1mTJmdD9yQ0J7t1fbsBJNDVN18Oc18ATrUwxHpwVJxsWQI.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdoPjT2mPf0k57ba3rGYkqoxA5NjTWFXpnsql2aym-QhN68_reMl3JptuJ55V3Hh1tM&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-5.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=VIJFju356